No Need for Arduino IDE, just upload this firmware to your esp and enjoy

Step 1 Download the latest version of this firmware
Step 2 go to https://espressif.github.io/esptool-js/
Step 3 Connect ESP32-S3 to your computer
Step 4 Enter Bootloader mode by holding BOOT and Quick Pressing RESET on the esp32
Step 5 On the website hit connect and select the esp32-s3
Step 6 Select the file to upload 
Step 7 Change Flash Address to 0x0
Step 8 Hit Program
Step 9 Enojy 
